invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_ifma_sign.c
catches: rsa_ifma_sign_model_test
reason: the exponentiation ends without its product by R mod m, so each
  power leaves in the kernel's domain, R' = 2^(52n), and not in
  rsa_mont64.c's, R = 2^(64k), which the recombination reads.
  bin/rsa_ifma_sign_model_test compares each exponentiation with
  rsa_sign64.c's window.

--- old
    product_pair(p.power, p.power, p.r_mod_m, record_p, q.power, q.power, q.r_mod_m, record_q);
--- new
